[I] Utility for listing and reaping zombie processes

[T] zps is a small utility for GNU/Linux that lists the running processes
[T] with their stats from /proc and highlights zombie (defunct) processes.
[T] It can also reap these zombie processes automatically by signalling
[T] their parent processes.

[U] https://github.com/orhun/zps

[A] Zps Authors
